- mods/tuix-tabs/main.js: Herdr's `tabs` mod (mods/tabs/main.js).
  Changed: "tuix" is appended to the enabled panels; a Tuix panel button
  shows shared("tuix.count"); the window-button art paths point at
  mods/tuix-tabs/.
- mods/tuix-tabs/mod.json: Herdr's `tabs` mod.json.
  Changed: the title is "Tuix tabs".
- mods/tuix-tabs/win-close.svg, win-max.svg, win-min.svg, win-restore.svg:
  Herdr's `tabs` mod art, unchanged.
- layouts/tuix.json: Herdr's `main` layout (layouts/main.json).
  Changed: the `tabs` block uses the `tuix-tabs` mod; a `tuix` block is
  appended to the `panel-body` stack.
